WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Packaging places occupants, cargo and major systems inside a defined envelope. Styling has to negotiate those hard volumes.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Reserve a seat, pedal box and luggage envelope first; then check whether the desired roof and hood shape still fit.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Packaging puzzle

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

